Third-party material vendored in this repository
------------------------------------------------
Each item below was read from the LICENSE file at the exact source commit named here (checked 14 Oct 2026). The
licence texts travel with the files.

models/r1/
  Unitree R1 MJCF model and its meshes, from unitreerobotics/unitree_rl_mjlab at commit
  1425b15f73bd4095f0df53709d7c389c3eb9e790 (src/assets/robots/unitree_r1/xmls/r1.xml and its
  mesh folder). Copyright Unitree Robotics. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  (models/r1/LICENCE = the repository's LICENCE file at that commit, byte for byte).
  The XML is stored unchanged under the name r1_mjlab.xml and its 43 meshes unchanged in
  models/r1/meshes/ (both checked byte for byte against that commit); every change the simulator makes
  (masses, hands, sensors, actuators) is applied at load time in code (sim/r1sim/model.py) and
  recorded in models/provenance.yaml.

models/dex3_1/
  Unitree Dex3-1 hand descriptions (dex3_1_l.urdf, dex3_1_r.urdf) and their 16 link meshes
  (meshes/*.STL), from unitreerobotics/unitree_ros at commit
  5994d4faef0a9cadd3287f8de0199a67eeb2a259 (robots/dexterous_hand_description/dex3_1/).
  Copyright (c) 2016-2022 HangZhou YuShu TECHNOLOGY CO.,LTD. ("Unitree Robotics").
  Licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License (models/dex3_1/LICENSE). Unchanged.

rt/idl/unitree_hg/, rt/idl/unitree_api/, rt/idl/crc.h
  Unitree's CycloneDDS-generated message headers (hg low-level and hand messages, the RPC
  envelope, the motion-switcher client declarations) and its CRC routine, from
  unitreerobotics/unitree_sdk2 at commit 63096d0ac0c5d2dec9d6e0c22cd5233410ca2f36, kept as a
  reference (not compiled). Copyright (c) 2016-2023 HangZhou YuShu TECHNOLOGY CO.,LTD.
  ("Unitree Robotics"). Licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License (rt/idl/LICENSE.unitree_sdk2).
  The IDL files under rt/idl/src/ are our reconstruction of those messages (Apache-2.0, this
  project); rt/idl/SOURCE.md records the checksums and how the reconstruction is proven.

Fetched at build time (not part of this repository)
---------------------------------------------------
  Eigen 3.4.0 (MPL-2.0; built with EIGEN_MPL2_ONLY), rt/cmake/Eigen.cmake, pinned by SHA256.
  GoogleTest 1.15.2 (BSD 3-Clause), for the C++ tests only, rt/CMakeLists.txt, pinned by SHA256.
  Eclipse Cyclone DDS and cyclonedds-cxx 0.10.2 (EPL-2.0 OR EDL-1.0), optional, built by
  rt/idl/build_cyclonedds.sh.
  The Python dependencies are installed by uv from PyPI (pyproject.toml, uv.lock); among them
  MuJoCo 3.5.0 (Apache-2.0), nanobind (BSD 3-Clause), mcap (MIT), NumPy (BSD 3-Clause),
  pydantic (MIT), PyYAML (MIT), OpenCV (Apache-2.0), ONNX (Apache-2.0).

Our own material
----------------
  policies/: the balance policy's weights were trained by us (mjlab, Apache-2.0, on the R1
  model above) and are released under this project's licence; docs/POLICY.md gives the
  checksums, the provenance and the training recipe.

